{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an <strong>adventure</strong> to save your home from a trio of mischievous crows! <strong>Tumble</strong> through challenging platforming levels as an egg and reach each nest to progress onward. <strong>Navigate</strong> treacherous cliffs, <strong>activate</strong> mechanisms, <strong>ride</strong> quick-moving platforms, and <strong>dodge</strong> impeding creatures that guard your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Reach The Nest</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nest is the goal of each level. Reach each nest to progress further and save your home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438340/extras/0dd8c495bb16fe1bcc8789f0b45693fb.poster.avif?t=1754868476\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438340/extras/0dd8c495bb16fe1bcc8789f0b45693fb.webm?t=1754868476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438340/extras/0dd8c495bb16fe1bcc8789f0b45693fb.mp4?t=1754868476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Activate Mechanisms</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanisms can be activated by flipping switches. Use them to your advantage as you explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438340/extras/40f235042e51e52e1198871d11c59e49.poster.avif?t=1754868476\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438340/extras/40f235042e51e52e1198871d11c59e49.webm?t=1754868476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438340/extras/40f235042e51e52e1198871d11c59e49.mp4?t=1754868476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Avoid Enemies</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for pesky creatures and obstructions that will push you off your path! Finding hiding places and agile movement will help you overcome them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438340/extras/1e064f0d8b289872afd116ce2a3db028.poster.avif?t=1754868476\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438340/extras/1e064f0d8b289872afd116ce2a3db028.webm?t=1754868476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438340/extras/1e064f0d8b289872afd116ce2a3db028.mp4?t=1754868476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Collect Coins</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone loves treasure! Discover the coins scattered along your journey. Some may be hidden or a challenge to reach, so use your tumbling skills to collect every coin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438340/extras/d389472495679b2305d4c2147928e10d.poster.avif?t=1754868476\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438340/extras/d389472495679b2305d4c2147928e10d.webm?t=1754868476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438340/extras/d389472495679b2305d4c2147928e10d.mp4?t=1754868476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Content</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 level themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic creatures and obstacles to challenge players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coins scattered across each level to reward challenge and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Illustrated backstory</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Spring Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3438340/e2f948a335e82fc50116cdc1bf3dc98ffc7be134.jpg"},{"name":"Summer Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3438340/72c9ca826b3ebb2608f4545096c01c8f66c690c7.jpg"},{"name":"Fall Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3438340/93a7a6cd6e504305a5182a5c2f5a60b8971d6202.jpg"},{"name":"Winter Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3438340/67f76b5ce7ed4b783534f01b46c8f5cf3c01b21e.jpg"},{"name":"Coin Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3438340/1273bad0733081c825688cc833b3e95624febccf.jpg"},{"name":"Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3438340/735f92739e624d34f3677fa9701002b178d4553f.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3438340?t=1754868476","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438340/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754868476","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438340/825a443a2f2f0ad8bf7a558cedc6ce3cb1d7ebdb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754868476","capsule_imagev5":"https: